e over 7.5 tonnes needs two consecutive slots\"},{\"text\":\"The facilities portal will not let you book the two consecutive slots for a vehicle over 7.5 tonnes separately.\",\"line\":6,\"span\":\"the portal will not let you book them separately\"},{\"text\":\"Dock slots open 14 days ahead.\",\"line\":11,\"span\":\"Slots open 14 days ahead\"},{\"text\":\"Dock slots close 4 hours before the slot starts.\",\"line\":11,\"span\":\"close 4 hours before the slot starts\"},{\"text\":\"There is no same-hour dock booking.\",\"line\":11,\"span\":\"There is no\\nsame-hour booking.\"},{\"text\":\"The dock booking phone line was retired.\",\"line\":16,\"span\":\"The dock booking phone line was retired\"},{\"text\":\"The dock booking phone number no longer connects.\",\"line\":16,\"span\":\"the number no longer connects\"},{\"text\":\"All dock bookings go through the portal.\",\"line\":16,\"span\":\"All\\nbookings go through the portal.\"},{\"text\":\"Drivers who call the old dock booking number hear a recorded message pointing them at the portal.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"Drivers who call the old number hear a recorded\\nmessage pointing them at the portal.\"},{\"text\":\"Drivers report to the gatehouse with the booking reference.\",\"line\":22,\"span\":\"Drivers report to the gatehouse with the booking reference.\"},{\"text\":\"The gatehouse checks the booking reference against the day sheet.\",\"line\":22,\"span\":\"The gatehouse checks\\nthe reference against the day sheet and directs the vehicle to a bay.\"},{\"text\":\"The gatehouse directs the vehicle to a bay.\",\"line\":22,\"span\":\"The gatehouse checks\\nthe reference against the day sheet and directs the vehicle to a bay.\"},{\"text\":\"A driver without a booking reference waits in the holding area until a slot is free.\",\"line\":23,\"span\":\"A driver\\nwithout a reference waits in the holding area until a slot is free.\"},{\"text\":\"A vehicle still on the bay 15 minutes after its slot ends is logged as an overrun.\",\"line\":28,\"span\":\"A vehicle still on the bay 15 minutes after its slot ends is logged as an\\noverrun.\"},{\"text\":\"After three overruns in a quarter, the supplier is asked to rebook through their account manager.\",\"line\":29,\"span\":\"Three overruns in a quarter and the supplier is asked to rebook through\\ntheir account manager.\"}]}","ttft_ms":8203,"type":"result","duration_ms":8240,"uuid":"55857359-d062-4d83-812c-c45480e5694b","ttft_stream_ms":1614,"time_to_request_ms":105,"first_content_frame_ms":1615,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
